{
  "contract": "ruvyxa.intercepting-routes",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "why": [
    "An intercepting route is discovered twice. `route_intercepts()` in",
    "crates/ruvyxa_graph/src/lib.rs answers for `ruvyxa build`, and",
    "`collectIntercepts()` in packages/ruvyxa/runtime/worker-pool.mjs answers",
    "for `ruvyxa dev`. An interception one host composes and the other does not",
    "is a modal that opens in production and does nothing locally — or the",
    "reverse, which is worse.",
    "",
    "Parallel-route slots already had this shape and no table; that gap is why",
    "the two `collectSlots`/`route_slots` implementations are only kept in step",
    "by a comment. This file covers the interception half.",
    "",
    "The target is computed from the *level's* URL, never from the slot folder:",
    "a slot contributes no URL segment, so for `app/feed/@modal/(.)photo` the",
    "marker `(.)` means the level `app/feed`, and the target is `/feed/photo`.",
    "Getting that wrong is invisible until a modal silently never opens.",
    "",
    "`tree` lists files to create under the app directory; every one is written",
    "with placeholder contents. `routeDir` is the directory of the route being",
    "resolved, relative to the app directory (empty string for the root route).",
    "`intercepts` is the expected result in emission order — level route id,",
    "slot name, target pattern, and the file relative to the app directory.",
    "",
    "One rule is deliberately absent: a marker that climbs above the app root is",
    "a build error (RUV1018) on the Rust side and is skipped by the worker,",
    "which never sees such a tree because discovery already refused it. Each",
    "host covers that in its own suite."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a marker at the root level targets a root route",
      "tree": ["page.tsx", "layout.tsx", "photo/page.tsx", "@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"],
      "routeDir": "",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/photo",
          "file": "@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the level's own URL is the base, not the slot folder",
      "tree": [
        "page.tsx",
        "feed/layout.tsx",
        "feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app/feed",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/feed/photo",
          "file": "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a route below the level inherits the same interception",
      "tree": [
        "page.tsx",
        "feed/layout.tsx",
        "feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed/photo",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app/feed",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/feed/photo",
          "file": "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a route above the level composes no layout that could show it",
      "tree": [
        "page.tsx",
        "feed/layout.tsx",
        "feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "",
      "intercepts": []
    },
    {
      "name": "one level up",
      "tree": [
        "photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/layout.tsx",
        "feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/(..)photo/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app/feed",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/photo",
          "file": "feed/@modal/(..)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "two levels up",
      "tree": [
        "photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/albums/layout.tsx",
        "feed/albums/page.tsx",
        "feed/albums/@modal/(..)(..)photo/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed/albums",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app/feed/albums",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/photo",
          "file": "feed/albums/@modal/(..)(..)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "from the app root, however deep the slot is",
      "tree": [
        "photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/albums/layout.tsx",
        "feed/albums/page.tsx",
        "feed/albums/@modal/(...)photo/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed/albums",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app/feed/albums",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/photo",
          "file": "feed/albums/@modal/(...)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "segments below the marker extend the target",
      "tree": [
        "feed/layout.tsx",
        "feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/album/[id]/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/(.)album/[id]/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app/feed",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/feed/album/[id]",
          "file": "feed/@modal/(.)album/[id]/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a route group in the level contributes no URL segment",
      "tree": [
        "(marketing)/feed/layout.tsx",
        "(marketing)/feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/photo/page.tsx",
        "(marketing)/feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "(marketing)/feed",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app/(marketing)/feed",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/feed/photo",
          "file": "(marketing)/feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "two slots at one level are ordered by slot name",
      "tree": [
        "feed/layout.tsx",
        "feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/preview/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/@aside/(.)preview/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app/feed",
          "name": "aside",
          "target": "/feed/preview",
          "file": "feed/@aside/(.)preview/page.tsx"
        },
        {
          "level": "app/feed",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/feed/photo",
          "file": "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "one slot carrying two interceptions is ordered by target",
      "tree": [
        "feed/layout.tsx",
        "feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/album/page.tsx",
        "feed/photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/(.)album/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app/feed",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/feed/album",
          "file": "feed/@modal/(.)album/page.tsx"
        },
        {
          "level": "app/feed",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/feed/photo",
          "file": "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a slot page with no marker is a parallel route, not an interception",
      "tree": [
        "feed/layout.tsx",
        "feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/default.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed",
      "intercepts": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a marker with nothing after it names no segment",
      "tree": ["feed/layout.tsx", "feed/page.tsx", "feed/@modal/(.)/page.tsx"],
      "routeDir": "feed",
      "intercepts": []
    },
    {
      "name": "interceptions at two different levels both reach a deep route",
      "tree": [
        "layout.tsx",
        "page.tsx",
        "photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/layout.tsx",
        "feed/page.tsx",
        "feed/photo/page.tsx",
        "@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx",
        "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
      ],
      "routeDir": "feed/photo",
      "intercepts": [
        {
          "level": "app",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/photo",
          "file": "@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
        },
        {
          "level": "app/feed",
          "name": "modal",
          "target": "/feed/photo",
          "file": "feed/@modal/(.)photo/page.tsx"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
